    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "You're a froggy creature searching for your family! Hop your way between mushrooms and lily pads as you carve your own path through the colorful yet dangerous swamp.<br>To survive you'll need to be fast, precise, and froggy to avoid all the dangers... <i>especially the water!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/5fe4e702284691977cca2b6f4ef3f97b.poster.avif?t=1751910070\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/5fe4e702284691977cca2b6f4ef3f97b.webm?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/5fe4e702284691977cca2b6f4ef3f97b.mp4?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Utilize your skills</strong></h2>With a persistent Bird chasing you and lurking Piranhas waiting below, you'll need every ounce of dexterity to survive and progress on this challenging journey - especially when bothersome Mosquitoes join the chase!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/951d3e176e0501294fbeedcd334073a1.poster.avif?t=1751910070\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/951d3e176e0501294fbeedcd334073a1.webm?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/951d3e176e0501294fbeedcd334073a1.mp4?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom of movement</strong></h2>Unlike other Precision Platformers where paths are predetermined, in Swamp Up, you're free for forging your own unique path through the swamp!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/0080555bf6303b7c72b6823a226cf28e.poster.avif?t=1751910070\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/0080555bf6303b7c72b6823a226cf28e.webm?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/0080555bf6303b7c72b6823a226cf28e.mp4?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u>Power-ups</u>: Find power-ups scattered throughout the map, to aid in your journey.<br></li><li><u>Multiple Levels</u>: Unlock new maps as you advance, each with its own set of unique challenges that demand different strategies from the player!<br></li><li><u>Upgrades</u>: Spend emblems acquired during your adventure to purchase upgrades that persist through your adventures!<br></li><li><u>Procedurally Generated Maps</u>: No matter which direction you explore, a path forward always exists, ensuring each playthrough is dynamic and unpredictable.<br></li><li><u>Records System</u>: Challenge yourself to achieve the greatest distances in the shortest time possible!<br></li><li><u>Replayability</u>: Procedural Generation ensures replay value and engagement beyond unlocking every level!<br></li><li><u>Skins</u>: Find NPCs and unlock new skins to use in your adventures!<br></li><li><u>Achievements</u>: Unlock Steam Achievements!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/39b9a91e1ce3b99f0594fe579317539c.poster.avif?t=1751910070\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/39b9a91e1ce3b99f0594fe579317539c.webm?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/39b9a91e1ce3b99f0594fe579317539c.mp4?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "You're a froggy creature searching for your family! Hop your way between mushrooms and lily pads as you carve your own path through the colorful yet dangerous swamp.<br>To survive you'll need to be fast, precise, and froggy to avoid all the dangers... <i>especially the water!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/5fe4e702284691977cca2b6f4ef3f97b.poster.avif?t=1751910070\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/5fe4e702284691977cca2b6f4ef3f97b.webm?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/5fe4e702284691977cca2b6f4ef3f97b.mp4?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Utilize your skills</strong></h2>With a persistent Bird chasing you and lurking Piranhas waiting below, you'll need every ounce of dexterity to survive and progress on this challenging journey - especially when bothersome Mosquitoes join the chase!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/951d3e176e0501294fbeedcd334073a1.poster.avif?t=1751910070\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/951d3e176e0501294fbeedcd334073a1.webm?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/951d3e176e0501294fbeedcd334073a1.mp4?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom of movement</strong></h2>Unlike other Precision Platformers where paths are predetermined, in Swamp Up, you're free for forging your own unique path through the swamp!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/0080555bf6303b7c72b6823a226cf28e.poster.avif?t=1751910070\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/0080555bf6303b7c72b6823a226cf28e.webm?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/0080555bf6303b7c72b6823a226cf28e.mp4?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u>Power-ups</u>: Find power-ups scattered throughout the map, to aid in your journey.<br></li><li><u>Multiple Levels</u>: Unlock new maps as you advance, each with its own set of unique challenges that demand different strategies from the player!<br></li><li><u>Upgrades</u>: Spend emblems acquired during your adventure to purchase upgrades that persist through your adventures!<br></li><li><u>Procedurally Generated Maps</u>: No matter which direction you explore, a path forward always exists, ensuring each playthrough is dynamic and unpredictable.<br></li><li><u>Records System</u>: Challenge yourself to achieve the greatest distances in the shortest time possible!<br></li><li><u>Replayability</u>: Procedural Generation ensures replay value and engagement beyond unlocking every level!<br></li><li><u>Skins</u>: Find NPCs and unlock new skins to use in your adventures!<br></li><li><u>Achievements</u>: Unlock Steam Achievements!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/39b9a91e1ce3b99f0594fe579317539c.poster.avif?t=1751910070\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/39b9a91e1ce3b99f0594fe579317539c.webm?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807240/extras/39b9a91e1ce3b99f0594fe579317539c.mp4?t=1751910070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Jump between mushrooms, collect power-ups and break records while exploring your own path through a procedurally generated map in this fun yet challenging Precision Platformer with Roguelite elements. Be fast, precise, and skillful to avoid all of its dangers. And remember, never touch the water.",
